        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A total of 22 residents and faculty from across Sindh participated in this activity. The workshop started with a",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "discussion on the risk factors for breech vaginal presentation. 'Victoria' provided a high-fidelity simulation in the operating room. Participants learned the appropriate steps and techniques for vaginal breech delivery, and",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "demonstrated good team dynamics and effective communication while dealing with breech delivery.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
